  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Developing an Action Plan for the Implementation of Nigeria&apos;s National Policy on Internally Displaced Persons</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">While it is challenging to confirm the overall number of people who are internally displaced in Nigeria, displacement is a recurrent phenomenon across the country, and protracted displacement represents a significant challenge in some areas. This project aims to strengthen institutional frameworks and capacities to realize the rights and obligations due to displaced persons and migrants across all spectrums through developing a National Action Plan for the implementation of the National Policy on internally displaced persons.</narrative>
  </description>
